<title>SRI LANKA: Development 12-mth net down 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Development 12-mth net down 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of ruepes unless stated):</p>
<p>				96/97	     95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover	    2,411.00   vs   2,265.00</p>
<p>    Net profit	    471.00   vs     590.00</p>
<p>    Tax provision	 179.00   vs     221.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Development Finance Corporation of Ceylon Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said the results were unaudited.</p>
<p>The company is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
